"Apex is the smaller, crescent-shaped northern part of Anesidora, across The Span from F City."
"In Apex the rules on using powers are heavily relaxed, and minor catastrophes are tolerated."
"High-ranking superhumans live, work, learn and experiment in Apex, and superheroes train there."
"Apex holds several universities with hero programs, Celena North among them."
"Each Apex university has affiliated prep high schools."
"Minors and non-Avowed in Apex wear a lanyard badge with an emergency button."
"Avowed carry a version of the Apex badge on their System IDs, so rescuers can prioritize them."
"Big Boom Town is a small Apex neighborhood of high-rank Wrights, full of explosions and robots."
"Car interfaces warn drivers as they near Big Boom Town."
"Hannah Elber's memorial service was held in Apex, at Celena North."
